WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.025
Check yourself with two questions.

2
00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:05.292
First: which certificate
authority issues the T L S

3
00:00:05.292 --> 00:00:08.637
inspection intermediate,
in the program's position?

4
00:00:08.637 --> 00:00:13.162
The answer is b: a dedicated
issuing C A under the agency's root,

5
00:00:13.162 --> 00:00:17.325
never the C A that issues
authentication certificates.

6
00:00:17.325 --> 00:00:21.187
Second: what happens when the
inspection certificate expires?

7
00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:25.229
The answer is b: all T L S
inspection across the tenant stops,

8
00:00:25.229 --> 00:00:31.038
so the guide renews at least ninety days
ahead and deploys trust before activation.

9
00:00:31.038 --> 00:00:36.000
The module page has three more questions,
each linked to the unit that answers it.
